function renderScenarioControls(){let config=[['Food',[0,.05,.10,.15]],['Shopping',[0,.05,.10,.20]],['Transport',[0,.05,.10]],['Entertainment',[0,.05,.10,.15]]];$('#scenario-controls').innerHTML=config.map(([cat,vals])=>`<div class="control-row"><div class="control-name">${esc(categoryText(cat))}<small>${esc(lang==='bn'?'সর্বশেষ তিন মাসের গড়':'recent 3-month average')}</small></div><div class="option-group">${vals.map(v=>`<button class="option-button ${Number(reductions[cat]||0)===v?'selected':''}" data-cat="${esc(cat)}" data-val="${v}" aria-pressed="${Number(reductions[cat]||0)===v}">${v===0?(lang==='bn'?'০%':'0%'):`-${number(v*100)}%`}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`).join('');$$('.option-button').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{let cat=b.dataset.cat,val=Number(b.dataset.val);if(val)reductions[cat]=val;else delete reductions[cat];renderScenarioControls();debouncedWhatIf()}))}
