      '<p class="method-footer">'+esc(tr('improvement'))+' vs '+esc(m.baseline_beaten||m.best_baseline||'baseline')+': <b>'+number(m.relative_mae_improvement_vs_baseline_pct)+'%</b> lower MAE ('+money(baseline.mae)+' baseline).</p><p class="method-footer">'+esc(tr('bestBaselineByMae'))+': '+esc(m.best_baseline||'—')+' · '+money(strongest.mae)+'; model difference '+number(m.relative_mae_improvement_vs_best_baseline_pct)+'%.</p>';
